  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-06-05T13:37:30+05:30\">June 5, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">1:37 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://ssc.nic.in/\">Staff Selection Commission (SSC Delhi Police)</a>,</strong> has released the<strong> Result </strong>on its&nbsp;<strong>official website</strong> for the Recruitment of <strong>Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Examination 2026.</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>Exam</strong>&nbsp;<span data-teams=\"true\">was conducted on<strong> 07 – 12 January 2026</strong></span><strong>,</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>SSC</strong> application process started on <strong data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"339\">29 September 2025</strong>, and candidates were able to submit their applications until&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"424\">20 October 2025</strong>. Candidates can check their <strong>Result</strong> using their <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"362\">Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong> by logging into the portal. The direct link is provided below.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n   