0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Notification 2025 : Age Limit As On 01 July 2025</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age :<strong> 18 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>25 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the <strong>Delhi</strong> <strong>Police Head Constable (Ministerial) </strong>position as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">456 Posts</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details </h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 125px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">456</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 34.9487%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 65.0513%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"86\" data-end=\"196\">\n<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"196\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"193\">10+2 (Senior Secondary) or equivalent examination from a recognized board</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"311\">\n<p data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"311\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Must possess a <strong data-start=\"214\" data-end=\"308\">typing speed of 30 words per minute in English OR 25 words per minute in Hindi on computer</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download SSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"120\" data-end=\"174\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Open your internet browser on your phone or computer</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"249\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the <strong data-start=\"187\" data-end=\"247\">official website of the Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"252\" data-end=\"352\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, go to the <strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"342\">Latest Notifications / Candidate Information / Exam Details</strong> section</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"445\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Look for the link that says <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"443\">SSC Delhi Police HC (Ministerial) Result 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"497\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the <b>Result </b>notification</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"584\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">You may need to enter your <strong data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"582\">Registration Number / Roll Number and Date of Birth</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"587\" data-end=\"669\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After entering details, your <strong data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"641\">result</strong> will appear on the screen</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"764\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">If the information opens as a <strong data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"709\">PDF</strong>, use the search feature to find your <strong data-start=\"747\" data-end=\"762\">roll number</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"830\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download or save the <strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"813\">result PDF</strong> to your device</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"833\" data-end=\"875\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"852\">printout</strong> for future reference</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;SSC Delhi Police Head Constable (Ministerial) Recruitment 2025 : Mode Of Selection&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>CBT</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>PE &amp; MT</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Trade Test</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Document Verification</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Medical Examination</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Join Our Telegram Channel</b></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\">\n<h5><strong>Download Result</strong></h5>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5